  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance Flexible Fund for Yemen (TAFFY)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of AFFY&apos;s business case addendum, our contribution to ISF Yemen&apos;s Flexible Funding Mechanism, TAFFY, will undertake programming to 1) Set out politically sensitive approaches to setting tariffs and 2) Address Political Barriers and Strengthen Institutional capacity for Private Sector Growth.</narrative>
